{
  "_game": "AI GameStore game7 (top-down extract shooter)",
  "_note": "uv sync --extra aigamestore: the vendored aigamestore-gym env (vendor/aigamestore), which needs a Chromium browser (system Chrome by default). Lock-stepped: fps must equal 60 / frame_skip (10 with the default frame_skip 6).",
  "_levels_note": "Procedurally generated levels without an upper bound; the first five are listed. An episode is one level, and ends on a win or a loss; reset() restarts the same level.",
  "_keys_note": "The env's action is MultiBinary over the game's keys, in aigamestore_gym.GAME_KEYS order -- game7: 0=LEFT, 1=RIGHT, 2=UP, 3=DOWN, 4=Z, 5=SPACE, 6=LSHIFT, 7=1, 8=2, 9=3, 10=4, 11=5 -- so 'keys' values are those indices (the JSON key is what the subject presses) and held keys combine. The env relabels the on-canvas hints to the pressed key; keep the message Controls text in sync with 'keys' by hand.",
  "_keys_reference": "https://github.com/tomov/fmri-gym/blob/main/vendor/aigamestore/game7/input.js",
